      <comment>[[Criminal profiler]] - a [[criminologist]] who studies a [[criminal]]'s behavior for clues</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Profiler''' has multiple meanings.
*[[Criminal profiler]] - a [[criminologist]] who studies a [[criminal]]'s behavior for clues to [[psychology]] to aid in capturing them. 
*In [[computer programming]], a '''[[profiler (computer science)|profiler]]''' is a program that can track the [[performance]] of another program.
*'''''[[Profiler (TV series)|Profiler]]''''' is a [[television]] [[drama]] series about a criminologist profiler that aired on [[NBC]].

