      <comment>disambiguation from [[Tivoli]] to [[Tivoli, Italy]] - ([[WP:DPL|You can help!]])</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">{{Infobox Pope|
English name=Innocent II|
image=[[Image:B Innozenz II.jpg|150px]]|
birth_name=Gregorio Papareschi|
term_start=[[February 14]], [[1130]]|
term_end=[[September 24]], [[1143]]|
predecessor=[[Pope Honorius II|Honorius II]]|
successor=[[Pope Celestine II|Celestine II]]|
birth_date=???|
