      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Paul Peter Piech''' ([[February 11]], [[1920]] &amp;ndash; [[May 31]], [[1996]]) was an American artist, born in New York of Ukrainian parents, known for his [[graphic art]] promoting [[pacifism|pacifist]] causes. He died in [[Porthcawl]], [[Wales]].

==External links==
