  <page>
    <title>Penlee House, Penzance, Cornwall</title>
    <id>24457</id>
    <revision>
      <id>36031305</id>
      <timestamp>2006-01-21T01:22:10Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>Merchbow</username>
        <id>802509</id>
      </contributor>
      <minor />
      <text xml:space="preserve">[[Image:Penlee_house.jpg|thumb|right|Penlee House Gallery and Museum]]''For other places called Penlee House, see [[Penlee House (disambiguation)]]''

'''Penlee House''' is a [[museum]] and [[art gallery]] located in the town of [[Penzance, Cornwall|Penzance]] in [[Cornwall]], and is home to a great many [[painting|paintings]] by members of the [[Newlyn School of Painting|Newlyn School]], including many by such luminaries as [[Stanhope Forbes]], [[Walter Langley]] and [[Lamorna Birch]].


==External links==
*[http://www.penleehouse.org.uk/ Penlee house website]

