      <comment>cleanup</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">{{wiktionarypar|pop}}
'''Pop''' may refer to:

*[[Pop culture]], the vernacular culture that prevails in any given society
*[[Pop music]], a subgenre of popular music
*[[Pop art]], a visual artistic movement that emerged in the late 1950s
*[[Pop icon]], a popular celebrity
*[[Pop (frozen snack)]], a snack on a stick or in a plastic or cardboard sleeve made from fruit juice or sugared water
*[[Lollipop]], a type of candy
*[[Popcorn]], a type of maize which puffs up when it is heated in oil or by dry heat
*[[Snap, Crackle and Pop|Pop]] is one of three animated mascots of Rice Krispies cereal
*[[Soft drink|Soda pop]], a soft drink
*[[Pop (album)|''Pop'' (album)]], a 1997 album by U2
*[[Pop (television channel)]], a free-to-air children's television channel in the UK
*A computer program instruction, see [[stack (computing)]]
*[[Post_office_protocol | Post Office Protocol]], (POP3), a protocal used by e-mail clients
*An onomatopoeic description of a sudden sharp [[explosion]], usually of relatively small magnitude

'''Pop''' may also be used as a name:
*a colloquial term for '[[Father#Terminology|father]]'
*the name of the first month of [[Haab]], the Mayan solar calendar
*the name of a character in ''[[Happy_Tree_Friends#Characters|Happy Tree Friends]]''

==See also==
*[[POP]]

{{disambig}}

